1
00:05:19,090 --> 00:05:25,090
Can you keep a secret?

2
00:10:38,181 --> 00:10:44,181
A Simple Favor is a thriller, comedy, mystery film directed by Paul Feig.

3
00:15:57,272 --> 00:16:03,272
Stephanie, a dedicated mother and popular vlogger, befriends Emily, a mysterious
upper-class woman whose son Nicky attends the same school as Miles, Stephanie's son.

4
00:21:16,363 --> 00:21:22,363
When Emily asks her to pick Nicky up from school and then disappears, Stephanie
undertakes an investigation that will dive deep into Emily's cloudy past.

5
00:26:35,454 --> 00:26:41,454
Stephanie Smothers, played by Anna Kendrick.

6
00:31:54,545 --> 00:32:00,545
Emily Nelson, played by Blake Lively.

7
00:37:13,636 --> 00:37:19,636
Sean Townsend, played by Henry Golding.

8
00:42:32,727 --> 00:42:38,727
Dennis Nylon, played by Rupert Friend.

9
00:47:51,818 --> 00:47:57,818
Diana Hyland, played by Linda Cardellini.

10
00:53:10,909 --> 00:53:16,909
Detective Summervile, played by Bashir Salahuddin.

11
00:58:29,999 --> 00:58:35,999
A Simple Favor is a 2018 American black comedy mystery film directed by Paul Feig from a
screenplay by Jessica Sharzer, based on the 2017 novel by Darcey Bell.

12
01:03:49,090 --> 01:03:55,090
It stars Anna Kendrick, Blake Lively, Henry Golding, and Andrew Rannells, and follows a small-town vlogger
(Kendrick) who tries to solve the disappearance of her elegant and mysterious friend (Lively).

13
01:09:08,181 --> 01:09:14,181
The film's development began in 2016 when 20th Century
Fox bought the rights to the novel.

14
01:14:27,272 --> 01:14:33,272
The following year, it was moved to Lionsgate with Feig hired to direct
while Kendrick and Lively were cast in the leading roles.

15
01:19:46,363 --> 01:19:52,363
Filming took place in Toronto, Ontario and began on February 2017.

16
01:25:05,454 --> 01:25:11,454
A Simple Favor was released theatrically by Lionsgate in
the United States on September 14, 2018.

17
01:30:24,545 --> 01:30:30,545
The film was met with a favourable response for its plot twists and
performances (especially that of Kendrick, Lively, and Golding).

18
01:35:43,636 --> 01:35:49,636
It grossed $97.6 million worldwide on a $20 million budget.

19
01:41:02,727 --> 01:41:08,727
A sequel, Another Simple Favor, was released on Amazon Prime Video on May 1, 2025, with
Kendrick and Lively reprising their roles, and Feig returning as director.

20
01:46:21,818 --> 01:46:27,818
The film explores themes of small town, based on novel or
book, widow, dark comedy, female friendship.

21
01:51:40,909 --> 01:51:46,909
The tone is lighthearted and dark and intense.
